      "claim": "Doxylamine succinate is an antihistamine. Antihistamines lessen the symptoms of allergic reactions and colds and help to treat insomnia (trouble sleeping). Pyridoxine hydrochloride is a form of vitamin B6. In the United States, the combination of doxylamine and pyridoxine can be found under the brand name Diclegis®. In Canada, it can be found under the brand name Diclectin®. Doxylamine succinate and/or pyridoxine hydrochloride are also available as over-the-counter medications.",
